text = "[center][font_size=24]THIRD-PARTY CREDITS[/font_size][/center]

[font_size=18] Voice Assets[/font_size]
This game uses audio assets from the \"audio-cmn\" project by Hugo Lopez (PLIDAM, INALCO).

* Asset: Chinese Syllables Audio Dataset (1,707 items, 64k compression)
* Voice Artist: Chen Wang
* Source: [url=https://github.com/hugolpz/audio-cmn]https://github.com/hugolpz/audio-cmn[/url]
* License: [url=https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/]Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0)[/url]

[font_size=18] Music [/font_size]
The background music is \"Ripples\" by Kevin MacLeod
\"Ripples\" Kevin MacLeod (incompetech.com)
Licensed under Creative Commons: By Attribution 4.0 License
http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

[font_size=18]Database[/font_size]
The underlying game database was partially derived and synthesized using data from the following open-source projects:

* Project: Make Me a Hanzi
* Source: [url=https://github.com/skishore/makemeahanzi]https://github.com/skishore/makemeahanzi[/url]
* License: Arphic Public License (stroke data) & GNU Lesser General Public License version 3 (dictionary data)

* Project: CHISE / IDS (Ideographic Description Sequences)
* Source: [url=https://github.com/chise/ids]https://github.com/chise/ids[/url]
* License: GNU General Public License (GPL) version 2

[i]Note: The audio files and source database structures are distributed under their respective open-source licenses. The inclusion of these data points and assets does not extend their licenses (such as CC BY-SA or GPL) to the game's underlying custom source code, engine mechanics, or unrelated proprietary files, which remain under their own respective licenses.[/i]
"
